        "evidence": "Title (braid-twist-flip.ts:6) and tags 'braid-group' (ts:7) call these 'Braid involutions'; the objects defined are two transposition-pair permutations of a 4-tuple generating V₄ (md:28-30), which are NOT braid-group generators (B_4 generators σ_i are not involutions and do not generate a Klein four-group).",
