        "evidence": "braid-twist-flip.md:28-30 asserts the generated group is the Klein four-group V₄={id,σ₁,σ₂,σ₁σ₂}. The Lean (braid-twist-flip.lean:38-50) proves only twistPerm and flipPerm are involutions and that they commute; it does NOT prove σ₁ ≠ σ₂ ≠ id ≠ σ₁σ₂ (the four elements are distinct), so 'generates V₄' (order exactly 4, not order ≤ 4) is not formalized.",
